        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Wreck is a 3D top-down isometric, local co-op, base defense game, where players take the role of train operators delivering cargo across multiple stations while fending off relentless train robbers set in the desert environment of a steamwest world. Players have to maintain fuel levels, defend their train from bandits and repair the damages . Each delivery route is filled with danger, and players achieve victory by successfully delivering cargos to all stations.<br><br>Keep the train alive. Keep it moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/8f1fcd8391640fbb435e94a039638e96.avif?t=1765055515\" width=646 height=221 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to manage your steam-powered train as it barrels through treacherous canyons and outlaw territory. Maintain fuel, repair damages, and fend off waves of relentless robbers who’ll do anything to derail your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player has a role: whether you’re shoveling coal, manning defenses, or patching bullet holes mid-ride, coordination is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/5112bdfec44571a61e0b5d751a577042.poster.avif?t=1765055515\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/5112bdfec44571a61e0b5d751a577042.webm?t=1765055515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/5112bdfec44571a61e0b5d751a577042.mp4?t=1765055515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/9416ed61d2ef90591a806888aba0666a.avif?t=1765055515\" width=646 height=221 /></span><br>Get on the mounted gun and fight back against the enemies by shooting at them. Hold your ground as waves of bandits try to follow you on horsecars. Time your shots, manage your ammo, and coordinate with your crew to keep the attackers from boarding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of the bombs, those can devastate your train.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/6fe5c1c4c4fd12a0eb90d14a8a758dd3.poster.avif?t=1765055515\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/6fe5c1c4c4fd12a0eb90d14a8a758dd3.webm?t=1765055515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/6fe5c1c4c4fd12a0eb90d14a8a758dd3.mp4?t=1765055515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/aaed7877959bca10cad97a3575490726.avif?t=1765055515\" width=646 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mile is a battle for survival in the scorching steamwest. The further you go, the tougher it gets: faster enemies, heavier damage, and tighter resource management. Only the most coordinated crews will make it to the final station. Deliver the cargo, defend your train, and prove your crew has what it takes to survive the Train Wreck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Wreck is a 3D top-down isometric, local co-op, base defense game, where players take the role of train operators delivering cargo across multiple stations while fending off relentless train robbers set in the desert environment of a steamwest world. Players have to maintain fuel levels, defend their train from bandits and repair the damages . Each delivery route is filled with danger, and players achieve victory by successfully delivering cargos to all stations.<br><br>Keep the train alive. Keep it moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/8f1fcd8391640fbb435e94a039638e96.avif?t=1765055515\" width=646 height=221 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to manage your steam-powered train as it barrels through treacherous canyons and outlaw territory. Maintain fuel, repair damages, and fend off waves of relentless robbers who’ll do anything to derail your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player has a role: whether you’re shoveling coal, manning defenses, or patching bullet holes mid-ride, coordination is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/5112bdfec44571a61e0b5d751a577042.poster.avif?t=1765055515\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/5112bdfec44571a61e0b5d751a577042.webm?t=1765055515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/5112bdfec44571a61e0b5d751a577042.mp4?t=1765055515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/9416ed61d2ef90591a806888aba0666a.avif?t=1765055515\" width=646 height=221 /></span><br>Get on the mounted gun and fight back against the enemies by shooting at them. Hold your ground as waves of bandits try to follow you on horsecars. Time your shots, manage your ammo, and coordinate with your crew to keep the attackers from boarding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of the bombs, those can devastate your train.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/6fe5c1c4c4fd12a0eb90d14a8a758dd3.poster.avif?t=1765055515\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/6fe5c1c4c4fd12a0eb90d14a8a758dd3.webm?t=1765055515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/6fe5c1c4c4fd12a0eb90d14a8a758dd3.mp4?t=1765055515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101680/extras/aaed7877959bca10cad97a3575490726.avif?t=1765055515\" width=646 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mile is a battle for survival in the scorching steamwest. The further you go, the tougher it gets: faster enemies, heavier damage, and tighter resource management. Only the most coordinated crews will make it to the final station. Deliver the cargo, defend your train, and prove your crew has what it takes to survive the Train Wreck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
